# NanoPi R76S (RK3576): CPUs 0-3 are Cortex-A53, 4-7 are Cortex-A72.
# Both ports are RTL8125 on PCIe. Same per-port layout as OpenWrt's
# 40-net-smp-affinity; names are after set_devs_r76s's ifrename, which
# swaps them relative to OpenWrt (its eth0 is our eth1).
eth1 10	# LAN -> CPU4
eth0 20	# WAN -> CPU5
# The RTL8822CS SDIO WiFi does one synchronous bus transfer at a time, so
# its throughput depends on how fast each transfer completes. Its controller
# IRQ goes on an A72; the rtw88 TX work follows it there, as unbound
# workqueues are kept on CPUs 4-7 by set_devs_r76s.
sdio 40	# SDIO WiFi -> CPU6
